
NTeX Release 1.2 --- nts-kpat 1.1 --- status: optional

The sources for the kpathsea library. You need this package to compile
web2c, dvi2ljk, dvipsk and xdvik. This package contains the sources for
version 2.1 which is needed for dvi2ljk, dvipsk and xdvik and the version
1.7 which is used for web2c.

